# Build context for the headless-server image (see Dockerfile).
#
# Without this file the context is whatever the working tree happens to contain:
# 1.7 GB on a developer machine, 420 MB of it web/node_modules and 78 MB .git,
# none of which the image needs (both stages re-install and rebuild from source).
# Everything below is either host state, a regenerated artifact, or a directory
# the image never reads.
.git
.github
**/node_modules
web/dist
web/dist-server
web/coverage
**/*.log
.DS_Store
